processing/node_modules
# The image installs its own deps via `bun install --frozen-lockfile`. Without
# this line a dev machine's app/node_modules (2.4GB, and symlinks into .bun when
# bunfig.toml globalStore is on) is copied over that install by `COPY app /app`,
# which fails outright: "cannot replace to directory ... with file". CI and the
# deploy hosts never noticed — they build from a fresh checkout that has no
# app/node_modules to copy.
app/node_modules
